1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,219
Ghosting.

2
00:00:01,219 --> 00:00:02,940
Nikki explained it to me.

3
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:04,200
I'm still upset.

4
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:04,820
You go on three

5
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:06,080
dates with somebody,

6
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:07,719
and then you just disappear?

7
00:00:08,599 --> 00:00:09,599
Kid,

8
00:00:09,599 --> 00:00:10,500
I drove a bus

9
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,119
for thirty-eight years.

10
00:00:12,119 --> 00:00:13,019
If I wasn't gonna make

11
00:00:13,019 --> 00:00:14,839
your stop, I told you.

12
00:00:14,839 --> 00:00:16,219
I said, "Sorry, folks,

13
00:00:16,219 --> 00:00:17,280
this bus is going

14
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:18,519
to the depot."

15
00:00:18,519 --> 00:00:19,179
You don't owe

16
00:00:19,179 --> 00:00:20,960
anybody a speech.

17
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:22,280
You owe them one sentence.

18
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:24,300
"I'm not feeling it.

19
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,019
I wish you well."

20
00:00:25,839 --> 00:00:26,899
Say it,

21
00:00:26,899 --> 00:00:27,379
and get off

22
00:00:27,379 --> 00:00:27,980
at your stop.

